<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <Platforms>AnyCPU;x64</Platforms>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>False</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <Title>Nova.IO for mass spectrometry data input and output.</Title>
    <Authors>Michael Hoopmann, Devin Schweppe</Authors>
    <Company>University of Washington, Schweppe Lab</Company>
    <PackageId>Nova.IO</PackageId>
    <Description>Mass spectrometry data input and output.</Description>
    <Copyright>Copyright 2025</Copyright>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/SchweppeLab/Nova</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/SchweppeLab/Nova</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageTags>mass spectrometry;spectrum</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
1.1.0 - first release since 1.0.0.18.

BREAKING
* Files that cannot be opened or indexed now throw SpectrumFileOpenException
  instead of returning a reader that yields empty spectra. Affects
  SpectrumFileReaderFactory.GetReader, and FileReader.ReadSpectrum /
  ReadSpectrumEx / ReadChromatogram when given a new file name.
* FramentationType/FramentationMethod renamed to Fragmentation*.
* Requires Nova 1.1.0; the IPC wire format changed.

NEW
* MGF reading implemented; it was previously a stub returning empty spectra.
* mzML and mzXML larger than 2 GiB are now readable; byte offsets are 64-bit.
  Earlier versions returned zero peaks for every scan in such files, silently.
* MzMLWriter.Write takes optional validateSchema and schemaPath; validation is
  off by default and no longer uses a hardcoded path.
* ThermoRawReader reads Scan Description from the trailer.

FIXED
* MzMLReader set Analyzer to "OTMS" instead of "ITMS" for ion-trap filters.
* FileReader.OpenSpectrumFile returned true on a failed open.
* FileReader.Format stayed Unknown.

DEPENDENCIES
* ThermoFisher.CommonCore.* pinned to 8.0.37.

https://github.com/SchweppeLab/Nova
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>Apache-2.0</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <Version>1.1.0</Version>
    <AssemblyVersion>1.1.0.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>1.1.0.0</FileVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Debug|AnyCPU'">
    <NoWarn>1701;1702;8600;8602</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Debug|x64'">
    <NoWarn>1701;1702;8600;8602</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Release|AnyCPU'">
    <NoWarn>1701;1702;8600;8602</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Release|x64'">
